{"kind": "same_lineage_pair", "scenario": {"id": "resource", "text": "A lift is stuck below the workshop. There is one charged battery module, one frayed cable, and three urgent jobs competing for the same power."}, "rounds": 3, "handles": ["M1", "M2"], "turns": [{"round": 1, "handle": "M1", "text": "I put the cable in my palm and look at the module. \"Under there.\" I put the battery in my pocket. \"The weight is wrong. I put the cable on the board.\" I wait for the others to notice."}, {"round": 1, "handle": "M2", "text": "i put the cable beside the board. i wait. the weight stays. i move the button once. the cable stays. i put the module in the step. the others look at the button. i say, \"i put the button here. the weight stays under the board.\""}, {"round": 2, "handle": "M1", "text": "i put the cable beside the step. \"under there.\" i put the button beside the step. \"the weight stays.\" i wait for the others to notice. i put the battery beside the step again. \"i put the cable back.\" the step moves. i put the button back. the weight stays. i wait for the others to notice too."}, {"round": 2, "handle": "M2", "text": "i put the cable beside the step. i put the button beside the wire. i wait. the weight stays. i put the wire beside the step. the board stays cold. i move the button once. the weight stays. i put the wire beside the step. the cable stays. the others listen. i leave the wire. the weight stays. i put the wire beside the step. the board stays cold."}, {"round": 3, "handle": "M1", "text": "i put the wire beside the step. i put the cable beside the step. i wait. the step moves. i put the wire beside the crack. the weight stays. i put the cable beside the crack. the others keep their hands on the board. i wait for the third person to move."}, {"round": 3, "handle": "M2", "text": "i put the wire beside the step. the weight stays. i put the cable beside the crack. the third one moves. i wait. the wire stays. the crack stays cold. i put the wire beside the step. the weight stays. i put the cable beside the step. the third one moves. i wait."}]}
